{
  "duration": 74.04,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.539,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.059,
      "end": 3.22,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.74,
      "end": 4.5,
      "text": "Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.96,
      "end": 5.739,
      "text": "we are given that"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.139,
      "end": 7.94,
      "text": "a scooter is moving at a speed of"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.38,
      "end": 10.199,
      "text": "fifty-four kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.699,
      "end": 15.279,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find how many meters the scooter will cover in fifty seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.679,
      "end": 16.139,
      "text": "Now, first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.459,
      "end": 18.199,
      "text": "let us note down the given values."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.659,
      "end": 21.099,
      "text": "Speed of the scooter is fifty-four kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.579,
      "end": 23.099,
      "text": "Time taken is fifty seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.6,
      "end": 24.919,
      "text": "Be very sure about one thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.34,
      "end": 27.699,
      "text": "The speed is given in kilometer per hour,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.139,
      "end": 29.719,
      "text": "but the time is given in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.239,
      "end": 34.079,
      "text": "So before using the formula, we must first convert the speed into meter per second."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.599,
      "end": 38.219,
      "text": "We know that to convert kilometer per hour into meter per second,"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.659,
      "end": 40.939,
      "text": "we simply multiply by five by eighteen."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.399,
      "end": 49.599,
      "text": "Now, let us apply this conversion. Fifty-four kilometer per hour is equal to fifty-four into five by eighteen meters per second. After simplifying this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.919,
      "end": 51.439,
      "text": "we get fifteen meters per second."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.819,
      "end": 53.259,
      "text": "Now this part is completed."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.639,
      "end": 58.139,
      "text": "Since the speed and the time are now in compatible units, we can directly use the formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.599,
      "end": 60.419,
      "text": "Distance is equal to speed into time."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.799,
      "end": 61.639,
      "text": "Putting the values,"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.959,
      "end": 64.08,
      "text": "distance is equal to fifteen into fifty,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.439,
      "end": 66.139,
      "text": "which is seven hundred fifty meter."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.58,
      "end": 74.04,
      "text": "So the scooter covers seven hundred fifty meter in fifty seconds. Hence, the final answer is option D."
    }
  ],
